\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Australia \highlight\uc2 's RBA Bulletin: Inherent Limitations To  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Market  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 361 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 2011\par 01:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SYDNEY (\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 )--\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets has only short-lived results that are of limited value, according to a report from the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  released Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The report reviews each period of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1983. It says the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has evolved to where participants are now better equipped to manage their own risk. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become less frequent and more targeted, and should be reserved chiefly for periods of market dysfunction.\par \par \uc2 The bank, using regression analysis, also gauges the effectiveness of its past \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , concluding that the results illustrate the inherent limitations of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which it says policymakers need to be aware of.\par \par \uc2 "When \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets are deep and liquid (and the capital account is open), the effects of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the level of the exchange rate are generally short-lived," it said.\par \par \uc2 "Moreover, under these 'normal' circumstances, the practical difficulties involved in determining what the 'fair value' of an exchange rate should be, suggest that it is difficult for policymakers to systematically improve on market outcomes, particularly in real time."\par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can play an important role in periods of severe market dysfunction, where it may become an important stabilizing force.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets between October and November 2008, in the aftermath of the collapse of U.S. investment bank Lehman Brother's. It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  nine times in that period, with prices between US$0.6000 and US$0.7700. The average size of the daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at that time was 0.47% of daily turnover.\par \par \uc2 Some policymakers called on the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets as the Australian dollar surged to 30-year highs earlier this year, above US$1.1000. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  argued that its policy was to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only when the market wasn't functioning appropriately.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Geoffrey Rogow, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \uc2 \f2 ; +61-2-8272-4686; geoffrey.rogow@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 15-12-11 0124GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111215e7cf0000q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
