\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: RBA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  To Support Australian Dollar Friday\b0\par\par\uc2 418 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2008\par 23:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Add reactions by markets strategists)\par \par \uc2 By James Glynn\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the Australian dollar in Europe on Friday as it plunged by seven U.S. cents to a five-year low of US$0.6057 in Europe, according to a spokesman for the RBA.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was designed "to add liquidity in an illiquid market", he said.\par \par \uc2 The RBA last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the Australian dollar in mid 2007 when the onset of the credit crisis pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sharply lower. The Australian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't target a level for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to restore liquidity and smooth market volatility.\par \par \uc2 In early Asia Monday, the Australian dollar had rebounded slightly. At 2205 GMT, it was quoted at US$0.6135.\par \par \uc2 Against the U.S. dollar, the Australian dollar has fallen by 37% since midyear amid growing concern about the world growth outlook.\par \par \uc2 Patricia Gacis, strategist at \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and New Zealand Banking Group\uc2  said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  began when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slipped through US$0.6100.\par \par \uc2 It is unclear how much the RBA spent as it dealt through a number of banks in the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , she said.\par \par \uc2 Greg Gibbs, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at ABN AMRO said if the intention of the RBA was only to add liquidity then the amount traded may not have been large.\par \par \uc2 "They probably didn't need to do a whole lot in that environment," he said.\par \par \uc2 Richard Grace, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at the \uc2 Commonwealth Bank of Australia\uc2  said the Australian dollar market has been suffering from a severe lack of liquidity, which is why it has been "gapping whole figures" in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Grace expects more pressure to be exerted on the Australian dollar this week as the end of the month approaches as investment funds adjust Australian-dollar hedges.\par \par \uc2 There is some speculation that Japanese investors are also pulling out cash from Australia, partly in reaction to recent moves by some fund managers to freeze redemptions.\par \par \uc2 The Australian dollar also plunged Friday against the yen Friday, dropping to around Y55 from Y66. At 2200 GMT, the cross rate was quoted at Y56.58.\par \par \uc2 Uncertainty surrounding the introduction of a government guarantee of bank deposits and wholesale funding has prompted moves by investors to shift savings out of unprotected cash management trusts into bank deposits.\par \par \uc2 -By James Glynn; Dow Jones Newswires; 612-8235-2955; james.glynn@dowjones.com [ 26-10-08 2219GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020081026e4aq0002b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
